*> The ranges of the entry being built by OVB-RULE (core/src/climate-overworld.cob): temperature, humidity and
*> weirdness, quantised. EXTERNAL.
 01 OVB-STATE EXTERNAL.
    05 OVB-T-LO             BINARY-DOUBLE.
    05 OVB-T-HI             BINARY-DOUBLE.
    05 OVB-H-LO             BINARY-DOUBLE.
    05 OVB-H-HI             BINARY-DOUBLE.
    05 OVB-W-LO             BINARY-DOUBLE.
    05 OVB-W-HI             BINARY-DOUBLE.
